<!DOCTYPE html>
<html xmlns:th="http://www.thymeleaf.org">

<head>

<meta charset="UTF-8">

<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Multimedia</title>

<link rel="stylesheet" th:href="@{/css/style.css}">

</head>

<body>

<header>

<h1>CSR Marketing Website</h1>

<nav>

<a th:href="@{/}">Home</a>

<a th:href="@{/about}">About</a>

<a th:href="@{/research}">Research</a>

<a th:href="@{/multimedia}">Multimedia</a>

<a th:href="@{/contact}">Contact</a>

</nav>

</header>

<section class="page-banner">

<h1>Multimedia Gallery</h1>

<p>

Explore all multimedia deliverables related to CSR Marketing.

</p>

</section>

<section class="multimedia">

<div class="media-card">

<h2>CSR Poster</h2>

<img
    src="/images/csr-poster.png"
    alt="CSR Poster"
    class="poster-image">

</div>

<div class="media-card">

<h2>Project Presentation</h2>

<a th:href="@{/ppt/CSR_Presentation.pdf}" target="_blank" class="btn">

Open Presentation

</a>

</div>

<div class="media-card">

<h2>CSR Video</h2>

<<video controls class="video-player">
    <source
        src="/videos/csr-video.mp4"
        type="video/mp4">
    Your browser does not support video playback.
</video>

</div>

<div class="media-card">

<h2>CSR Podcast</h2>

<audio controls>

<source th:src="@{/audio/csr_audio.mp3}" type="audio/mpeg">

</audio>

</div>

<div class="media-card">

<h2>Research Images</h2>

<div class="gallery">

<img th:src="@{/images/img1.jpg}">

<img th:src="@{/images/img2.jpg}">

<img th:src="@{/images/img3.jpg}">

</div>

</div>

</section>

<footer>

<h3>CSR Marketing Website</h3>

<p>

Social Media as a Tool for Marketing in Corporate Social Responsibility (CSR)

</p>

<p>

© 2026 All Rights Reserved

</p>

</footer>

</body>

</html>